Subject: [PATCH 39/39] Resolution: the fork-main conflicts of this series on
 ceb9e1f7a

The series was first built as merges (fork main 006c3530, 46bf5351, f6a09d3b,
ceb9e1f7 merged into it). Linearised onto ceb9e1f7a, the conflicting hunks of
#995, #1005, #927, #854/#993, the frame clock and the striped host-heap lock were
taken from the picked side; this patch brings in the merge-time resolutions, so the
full series gives exactly the tree of daily-pr9b (9be0a3eb).

